From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] imagehlp: BindImageEx, ReBaseImage, SplitSymbols, UpdateDebugInfoFile, RemovePrivateCvSymbolic (3646)

imagehlp: BindImageEx, ReBaseImage(64), SplitSymbols, UpdateDebugInfoFile(Ex), RemovePrivateCvSymbolic

New rewrite.c holds the PE file rewriters that were stubs.  BindImageEx binds the import
tables (IAT values, TimeDateStamp -1, bound import directory with forwarder references,
header growth when the directory does not fit, BIND_* flags, status callbacks).
ReBaseImage/ReBaseImage64 compute the next base and apply base relocations.
SplitSymbols writes a .DBG file and strips the image, UpdateDebugInfoFile(Ex) refresh the
.DBG header, RemovePrivateCvSymbolic filters a CodeView 4 block.
---
